1
00:00:00,327 --> 00:00:01,827
...even if I didn't go to space, heh.

2
00:00:02,037 --> 00:00:05,957
You know, l've got an lD card
and a NASA goIf shirt.

3
00:00:06,166 --> 00:00:07,206
No, no. You gotta go.

4
00:00:07,417 --> 00:00:09,627
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You can't turn down
an opportunity like this.

5
00:00:11,088 --> 00:00:12,258
(Howard:)But what about the wedding...

6
00:00:12,464 --> 00:00:14,754
(Howard:)...and all the money you put down
for the reception?

7
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:16,467
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You let me worry about that.

8
00:00:16,677 --> 00:00:20,517
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You go up to that space station
and you make me proud.

9
00:00:25,185 --> 00:00:26,225
(Howard:)Um, okay.

10
00:00:27,688 --> 00:00:29,318
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You got a problem with that?

11
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,900
(Howard:)All right, look,
I'm gonna level with you.

12
00:00:32,109 --> 00:00:35,319
(Howard:)I'm terrified about going into space.

13
00:00:35,529 --> 00:00:38,699
I mean, uh,
what if I don't make it back?

14
00:00:39,283 --> 00:00:41,703
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)It's gonna be okay, son.

15
00:00:43,537 --> 00:00:46,787
- You really think so?
- Of course.

16
00:00:46,999 --> 00:01:00,019
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)A pretty girl like Bernadette.
She'll find a new guy.

